{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2023-04-13 03:30:00', 'title': 'AIG APPOINTS CHRIS COLAHAN AS REGIONAL PRESIDENT, AIG ASIA PACIFIC', 'text': "SINGAPORE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: AIG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHRIS COLAHAN HAS BEEN APPOINTED REGIONAL PRESIDENT, AIG ASIA PACIFIC, AND WILL JOIN THE COMPANY IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2023. MR. COLAHAN WILL REPORT TO JON HANCOCK, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AIG'S INTERNATIONAL GENERAL INSURANCE BUSINESS. MR."}